<!-- 文件职责 / File responsibility: 通过唯一注册表编辑尾巴整体、根段、分段和尾尖发光。 / Edits overall tail, root, segments, and tip glow through the sole registry. -->
<script setup lang="ts">
import StudioNumericControl from './StudioNumericControl.vue';import {MAX_TAIL_SEGMENTS,MIN_TAIL_SEGMENTS,PET_STUDIO_PART_OPTIONS,type TailDesignRecipe,type TailSegmentRecipe} from '~/domain/pet-studio-phase2';import type {StudioControlPath} from '~/domain/studio-control-registry';import {usePetAppearanceStore} from '~/stores/pet-appearance';const store=usePetAppearanceStore();const recipe=computed(()=>store.recipe);type RK=keyof Omit<TailDesignRecipe,'segments'|'tipGlow'|'direction'>;type SK=keyof TailSegmentRecipe;const roots:Array<[StudioControlPath,RK]>=[['tailDesign.rootOffsetX','rootOffsetX'],['tailDesign.rootOffsetY','rootOffsetY'],['tailDesign.rootOffsetZ','rootOffsetZ'],['tailDesign.rootExtensionLength','rootExtensionLength'],['tailDesign.rootExtensionWidth','rootExtensionWidth'],['tailDesign.lateralOffset','lateralOffset']];const segments:Array<[StudioControlPath,SK]>=[['tailDesign.segments.*.length','length'],['tailDesign.segments.*.width','width'],['tailDesign.segments.*.offsetX','offsetX'],['tailDesign.segments.*.offsetY','offsetY'],['tailDesign.segments.*.offsetZ','offsetZ'],['tailDesign.segments.*.rotationX','rotationX'],['tailDesign.segments.*.rotationY','rotationY'],['tailDesign.segments.*.rotationZ','rotationZ']];function setPart(e:Event){store.checkpoint();store.patchParts({tail:(e.target as HTMLSelectElement).value as typeof recipe.value.parts.tail})}function add(){if(recipe.value.tailDesign.segments.length>=MAX_TAIL_SEGMENTS)return;store.checkpoint();recipe.value.tailDesign.segments.push({length:.4,width:.15,offsetX:0,offsetY:0,offsetZ:0,rotationX:0,rotationY:0,rotationZ:0});store.markDirty()}function remove(i:number){if(recipe.value.tailDesign.segments.length<=MIN_TAIL_SEGMENTS)return;store.checkpoint();recipe.value.tailDesign.segments.splice(i,1);store.markDirty()}
</script>
<template><section class="editor"><header><small>TAIL</small><h2>尾巴</h2></header><section class="card"><h3>整体尾巴</h3><label>基础样式<select :value="recipe.parts.tail" @change="setPart"><option v-for="item in PET_STUDIO_PART_OPTIONS.tails" :key="item.id" :value="item.id">{{item.label}}</option></select></label><StudioNumericControl path="proportions.tailLength" :model-value="recipe.proportions.tailLength" @update:model-value="recipe.proportions.tailLength=$event"/><StudioNumericControl path="proportions.tailWidth" :model-value="recipe.proportions.tailWidth" @update:model-value="recipe.proportions.tailWidth=$event"/></section><section class="card"><h3>背部根段</h3><label>尾巴朝向<select v-model="recipe.tailDesign.direction" @focus="store.checkpoint" @change="store.markDirty"><option value="left">向左</option><option value="right">向右</option><option value="up">向上</option><option value="down">向下</option><option value="back">向后</option><option value="forward">向前</option></select></label><StudioNumericControl v-for="[path,key] in roots" :key="path" :path="path" :model-value="recipe.tailDesign[key]" @update:model-value="recipe.tailDesign[key]=$event"/></section><section class="card"><h3>尾巴尖发光</h3><label class="check"><input v-model="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.enabled" type="checkbox" @focus="store.checkpoint" @change="store.markDirty">启用</label><label>颜色<input v-model="recipe.customization.colors.tailGlow" type="color" @focus="store.checkpoint" @input="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.color=recipe.customization.colors.tailGlow;store.markDirty()"></label><StudioNumericControl path="tailDesign.tipGlow.intensity" :model-value="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.intensity" @update:model-value="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.intensity=$event"/><StudioNumericControl path="tailDesign.tipGlow.auraScale" :model-value="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.auraScale" @update:model-value="recipe.tailDesign.tipGlow.auraScale=$event"/></section><section class="segments"><div class="heading"><h3>分段尾巴 {{recipe.tailDesign.segments.length}} / {{MAX_TAIL_SEGMENTS}}</h3><button :disabled="recipe.tailDesign.segments.length>=MAX_TAIL_SEGMENTS" @click="add">增加一段</button></div><details v-for="(segment,index) in recipe.tailDesign.segments" :key="index"><summary>第 {{index+1}} 段<button :disabled="recipe.tailDesign.segments.length<=MIN_TAIL_SEGMENTS" @click.prevent="remove(index)">删除</button></summary><StudioNumericControl v-for="[path,key] in segments" :key="path" :path="path" :model-value="segment[key]" @update:model-value="segment[key]=$event"/></details></section></section></template>
<style scoped>.editor,.card,.segments{display:grid;gap:9px}.editor>header small{color:#777f9f;font:800 8px ui-monospace}.editor>header h2{margin:4px 0}.card,.segments,details{padding:11px;border:1px solid #ffffff15;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff05}.card h3,.segments h3{margin:0;font-size:12px}.card label{display:grid;gap:5px;color:#bbc3dc;font-size:11px}.card select{min-height:36px;border:1px solid #ffffff20;border-radius:9px;color:#fff;background:#090e1b}.card input[type=color]{width:100%;height:34px;border:0;background:transparent}.check{display:flex!important;align-items:center!important}.heading,summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.heading button,summary button{border:1px solid #ffffff20;border-radius:8px;color:#fff;background:#ffffff08}</style>
